  a tool result naming the failing property paths and constraint, never the offending value, instead of
  reaching the executor. Extra properties pass through unchanged. `register` throws, naming the tool, when a
  static schema cannot be compiled. Executors that hand-validated their input now receive only input the
  schema already accepts.
""",1)
